OL,3,AA wave of homemade, synthetic drugs
OL,4,Asweeps US and deepens crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains
OL,7,Fdescriptions of drug-taking from the
OL,8,Fstart and discusses suicide
OL,10,FThe few grains of fentanyl sit in the
OL,11,Fsilver foil as a straw, held between
OL,12,FMike's lips, hovers above, with a
OL,13,Fcigarette lighter below. The
OL,14,F48-year-old army veteran is crouched
OL,15,Flow in an alleyway in Columbus, Ohio's
OL,16,FLinden neighbourhood.
OL,18,F"This drug will damn near make you do
OL,19,Fanything, unfortunately," he says.
OL,21,FThe hit he's smoking cost three or four
OL,22,Fdollars.
